1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,308
I put one habit down.
Thought I was good to go.

2
00:00:11,308 --> 00:00:22,616
Then a different hunger came.
Same ache, different clothes.

3
00:00:22,616 --> 00:00:33,924
Different label, same flame.
Different road, same rain.

4
00:00:33,924 --> 00:00:45,232
I am not broken, I am learning.
The pattern knows my name.

5
00:00:45,232 --> 00:00:56,540
Same loop, new name.
Trigger to craving, back again.

6
00:00:56,540 --> 00:01:07,848
Short relief, heavy return.
I can face what is true.

7
00:01:07,848 --> 00:01:19,156
Same loop, new name.
I can slow it. I can change.

8
00:01:19,156 --> 00:01:30,464
One clear pause, one breath.
I choose a different step.

9
00:01:30,464 --> 00:01:41,772
Stress at midnight.
Lonely mornings pull hard.

10
00:01:41,772 --> 00:01:53,080
Food, scrolling, spending.
Work, nicotine, dodge the dark.

11
00:01:53,080 --> 00:02:04,388
My mind learned survival
from whatever eased pain.

12
00:02:04,388 --> 00:02:15,696
Now I teach it gentler ways.
Not perfect - just real.

13
00:02:15,696 --> 00:02:27,004
Map the hour and feeling.
Build a refuge that holds.

14
00:02:27,004 --> 00:02:38,312
If risk rises, get medical help.
Then heal the deeper pattern.

15
00:02:38,312 --> 00:02:49,620
Hypnotherapy for the pause.
EFT to calm the wave.

16
00:02:49,620 --> 00:03:00,928
Small repeats make a pathway.
The pathway starts to change.

17
00:03:00,928 --> 00:03:12,236
Same loop, new name.
I know the pattern.

18
00:03:12,236 --> 00:03:23,544
Trigger to craving
does not own me now.

19
00:03:23,544 --> 00:03:34,852
Same brain, new patterns.
Day by day, I find my way.

20
00:03:34,852 --> 00:03:46,160
What was automatic can be relearned.
Same loop, new ending.
